@startuml
actor User
participant Controller
participant EvaluationService
participant OrderService
database Database

User -> Controller: 发起订单评价请求
activate Controller
Controller -> EvaluationService: 调用orderCv方法
activate EvaluationService
EvaluationService -> Database: 保存评价信息到数据库
activate Database
Database --> EvaluationService: 返回保存成功
deactivate Database
EvaluationService -> OrderService: 调用updateStatus方法更新订单状态
activate OrderService
OrderService --> EvaluationService: 返回更新订单状态成功
deactivate OrderService
EvaluationService --> Controller: 返回订单评价成功信息
deactivate EvaluationService
Controller --> User: 返回订单评价成功信息
deactivate Controller
@enduml
